# Panel and harbor lane output. `run_codepolicy_harbor2_smr2_panel.py` writes
# lane working directories under `submissions/_panel/`, and every harbor lane
# writes a `rollout.json` carrying base64'd `~/.codex/auth.json` — Codex OAuth
# access AND refresh tokens — or a raw OPENAI_API_KEY (`adapters/harbor/scripts/_lib.sh:96-100`).
# Nothing expires, revokes, or deletes those files, so an untracked-but-not-ignored
# tree is one `git add -A` away from committing live credentials.
submissions/
rollout.json
